    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #63 Forensics & Parameter Mutation\nOut-of-sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash revealed severe fee drag (\u20b936.66 fees on 10 trades) and stop-out clustering during the 10:25\u201310:40 IST transition window. Entries triggered on 2.0x volume sweeps suffered immediate mean-reversion whipsaws against the tight `0.45%` stop floor, while post-14:20 IST entries decayed into EOD square-offs. To harden the execution engine against NSE microstructure noise, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to `0.60%` to absorb intraday pullbacks, elevating `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to `2.40x` to demand true institutional participation, expanding `min_target_pct` to `1.35%` to improve net payoff over fixed brokerage hurdles, and pulling `breakeven_trigger_r` down to `0.85R` to eliminate fee-induced losses on stalling afternoon trades."
